# SDD Workflow

Before implementing features:

1. Read `specifications/REPO_SPEC.md`
2. Read or create `specifications/<branch-name>/SPEC.md` for the active branch
3. Branch SPEC inherits REPO_SPEC; override only where explicitly scoped

When user prompts change requirements, scope, or acceptance criteria, update the branch `SPEC.md` incrementally.

Do not rewrite `REPO_SPEC.md` on feature branches unless introducing durable repo-wide truth. Use iteration branches to promote stable guidance (see `sdd.md`).
